# Copy to `.env.local` and fill in. `.env.local` is git-ignored; this file is not,
# so it carries the names and never the values.

# GoldRush (Covalent) key, read by `hook/history.ts`.
#
# Only BNB Smart Chain needs it: its explorer data is sold with a paid Etherscan
# plan, so the history list there is empty without a key. Every other built-in
# chain is served by a Blockscout that asks for nothing, and the app runs fine
# with this unset — that path degrades to an empty list rather than failing.
#
# Note it ends up inside the shipped bundle, as any key a frontend uses must.
VITE_COVALENT_KEY=
